    "and merge evidence point at its commits (CULTURE: fix-up commits and a merge of main; squashing happens only at merge).",
    "Instead:",
    "  bring a PR up to date with main:   gh pr update-branch <PR>      (a merge commit; no --rebase)",
    "                                     or: git fetch origin && git merge origin/main && git push",
    "  fix something:                     a new commit on the branch, then a plain git push",
    "Squash before the FIRST push only (git reset --soft \"$(git merge-base HEAD origin/main)\"). If history truly must change, ask the operator.",
